  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participatory Forest Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The effort is part of the environmental aid to Tanzania. The overall objective is improved and sustainable management of Tanzania&apos;s forest resources that can contribute to improved living conditions for the population, especially in the poor rural areas. The immediate goal is at the national level to support the government in developing and implementing a national framework for participatory forest management and local level to support local-based forest management in four regions.</narrative>
  </description>
